Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 20ms

Hide
Type "pkill -f 'muxr.*--server shot' 2>/dev/null; pkill -f 'muxr.*--server api' 2>/dev/null; pkill -f 'muxr.*--server notes' 2>/dev/null; true"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "source docs/screenshots/tapes/isolate.sh"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
